	)
	(text "Differential-mode LC stage on the PSU branch, inserted between fuse F1 (1 A slow blow) and the existing RV1 / C1 (X2) / L1 (CM choke) / PS1 chain:\nLINE_FUSED -> L40 120 uH (IND-120UH-THT, radial D22.5 mm, P9 mm) -> LINE_FILT; C40 1 uF 275 VAC X2 (Faratronic C42P2105KBSC400, P27.5 mm) from LINE_FILT to NEUT.\nWith C1 (100 nF X2) the stage is a pi-filter: fc = 1/(2*pi*sqrt(120u*1u)) = 14.5 kHz, ~40 dB/dec above it; attenuates the HLK-10M05 switching\nfundamental (~65 kHz) by ~26 dB and its harmonics more. Carries only the PSU current (<100 mA), not the heater or fan current.\nLayout: keep L40 away from the thermocouple input and the LCD bus (unshielded choke); C40 bleeder is R6/R7 (2x33k) already on the root sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
